is ideal for clearing partially closed pilot holes, refining screw fits, and handling other precise manual drilling tasks.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/64b502e87ff7423189236685f1e95a87/5.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/64b502e87ff7423189236685f1e95a87/5.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-icpc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">In The Box</span></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 171px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Item Name</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Maker's Supply Hand Drill Kit</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Hand Drill Handle</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 20%; height: 27px; text-align: center;\">Tungsten Steel Drill Bits</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<t